    "https://www.bryant.edu/undergraduate/why-bryant/explore-your-path": {
      "title": "Explore Your Path",
      "description": "Explore Your Path | Bryant University We value your privacy We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalized ads or content, and analyze our traffic. By clicking \"Accept All\", you consent to our use of cookies. Customize Reject All Accept All Customize Consent Preferences We use cookies to help you navigate efficiently and perform certain functions. You will find detailed information about all cookies under each consent category below. The cookies that are categorized as \"Necessary\" are stored on your browser as they are essential for enabling the basic functionalities of the site.... Show more Necessary Always Active Necessary cookies are required to enable the basic features of this site, such as providing secure log-in or adjusting your consent preferences. These cookies do not store any personally identifiable data. Cookie __cf_bm Duration 1 hour Description This cookie, set by Cloudflare, is used to support Cloudflare Bot Management. Cookie visid_incap_* Duration 1 year Description Incapsula sets this cookie to provide cloud-based website security services. Cookie incap_ses_* Duration session Description This is an Incapsula DDoS Protection and Web Application Firewall cookie that is used to relate HTTP requests to a certain session. Cookie _node Duration session Description No description available. Cookie _hash Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description No description available. Cookie PHPSESSID Duration session Description This cookie is native to PHP applications. The cookie stores and identifies a user's unique session ID to manage user sessions on the website. The cookie is a session cookie and will be deleted when all the browser windows are closed. Cookie ASLBSA Duration session Description No description available. Cookie ASLBSACORS Duration session Description No description available. Cookie ENCOMPASSCC_1434 Duration session Description Stores visitor consent preferences for cookies on the Bryant alumni portal, preserving chosen privacy settings across pages and future visits. Cookie ENCOMPASSSESSIONID_1434 Duration session Description Maintains secure session for Encompass login, enabling single sign-on and preserving authentication with return URL while navigating protected alumni pages. Cookie IGXSessionState Duration session Description No description available. Cookie _hr_suite_session_1 Duration 12 hours Description No description available. Cookie reese84 Duration 1 month Description No description available. Cookie _cookie_test Duration session Description Used by Goucher's application portal to verify cookie support, enable login redirects, and maintain session continuity during account access process. Cookie test Duration session Description No description available. Cookie VISITOR_PRIVACY_METADATA Duration 6 months Description YouTube sets this cookie to store the user's cookie consent state for the current domain. Cookie wpEmojiSettingsSupports Duration session Description WordPress sets this cookie when a user interacts with emojis on a WordPress site. It helps determine if the user's browser can display emojis properly. Cookie __RequestVerificationToken Duration session Description This cookie is set by web application built in ASP.NET MVC Technologies. This is an anti-forgery cookie used for preventing cross site request forgery attacks. Cookie rc::a Duration Never Expires Description This cookie is set by the Google recaptcha service to identify bots to protect the website against malicious spam attacks. Cookie rc::c Duration session Description This cookie is set by the Google recaptcha service to identify bots to protect the website against malicious spam attacks. Cookie OptanonConsent Duration 1 year Description OneTrust sets this cookie to store details about the site's cookie category and check whether visitors have given or withdrawn consent from the use of each category. Cookie OptanonAlertBoxClosed Duration 1 year Description OneTrust sets this cookie to allow it to set cookies based on the user's consent and hide the cookies banner once the user has read and acknowledged it. Cookie TiPMix Duration 1 hour Description The TiPMix cookie is set by Azure to determine which web server the users must be directed to. Cookie x-ms-routing-name Duration 1 hour Description Azure sets this cookie for routing production traffic by specifying the production slot. Cookie .AspNetCore.Antiforgery.* Duration session Description This cookie is set by Microsoft AspNet for the purpose of Anti-forgery protection. Cookie DBMS_RETURNURL_* Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description This cookie is used to store the URL of the page a user was attempting to access before being redirected Cookie __Secure-ENID Duration 1 year 1 month Description The __Secure-ENID cookie is a type of secure cookie used for authentication and to ensure the security of user sessions. Cookie cookietest Duration session Description The cookietest cookie is typically used to determine whether the user's browser accepts cookies, essential for website functionality and user experience. Cookie aa-cookie-test Duration session Description Description is currently not available. Cookie cookieyes-* Duration 1 year Description CookieYes sets this cookie for consent solution management. Functional Functional cookies help perform certain functionalities like sharing the content of the website on social media platforms, collecting feedback, and other third-party features. Cookie _gcl_au Duration 3 months Description Google Tag Manager sets this cookie to experiment advertisement efficiency of websites using their services. Cookie li_gc Duration 6 months Description Linkedin set this cookie for storing visitor's consent regarding using cookies for non-essential purposes. Cookie lidc Duration 1 day 1 minute Description LinkedIn sets the lidc cookie to facilitate data center selection. Cookie CDNPHPSESSID Duration session Description Stores a temporary session identifier enabling YouVisit embedded tour features, preserving user interactions, preferences, and state across pages during visits. Cookie Stl_Launch Duration session Description Stores site configuration and campaign launch preferences, enabling correct loading of planned giving features and persisting user choices across visits. Cookie Stl_Org Duration 2 hours Description Stores the nonprofit’s identifier and site settings to deliver correct branding, content, and seamless navigation across planned giving website sections. Cookie bgColor Duration session Description No description available. Cookie bp_plack_session Duration session Description Stores temporary session data to maintain advanced search filters, pagination, and browsing preferences across Whitworth Digital Commons honors repository pages. Cookie VISITOR_INFO1_LIVE Duration 6 months Description A cookie set by YouTube to measure bandwidth that determines whether the user gets the new or old player interface. Cookie ytidb::LAST_RESULT_ENTRY_KEY Duration Never Expires Description The cookie ytidb::LAST_RESULT_ENTRY_KEY is used by YouTube to store the last search result entry that was clicked by the user. This information is used to improve the user experience by providing more relevant search results in the future. Cookie mid Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description The mid cookie is set by Instagram to personalize user experience by remembering user preferences and settings. Cookie navigationCache Duration 15 minutes Description Stores cached navigation data to speed page loads, remember topbar state, and persist menu preferences and recent links across sessions. Analytics Analytical cookies are used to understand how visitors interact with the website. These cookies help provide information on metrics such as the number of visitors, bounce rate, traffic source, etc. Cookie _ga_* Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to store and count page views. Cookie _ga Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to calculate visitor, session and campaign data and track site usage for the site's analytics report. The cookie stores information anonymously and assigns a randomly generated number to recognize unique visitors. Cookie nmstat Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description This cookie is set by SiteImprove. This cookie is used for web analytics, the cookie contain a ID string about the session. The cookie records the visitor use of the website. This information is used to improve the site experience.The cookie does not contain any personal information. Cookie _gid Duration 1 day Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to store information on how visitors use a website while also creating an analytics report of the website's performance. Some of the collected data includes the number of visitors, their source, and the pages they visit anonymously. Cookie _gat_UA-* Duration 1 minute Description Google Analytics sets this cookie for user behavior tracking. Cookie gpv_evar7 Duration 1 hour Description Stores the previous value of an Adobe Analytics eVar to track changes between pages for journey analysis, attribution, and reporting. Cookie gpv_evar8 Duration 1 hour Description Stores the previous value of Adobe Analytics eVar 8 across pages to analyze navigation sequences, attribution changes, and behavior trends. Cookie bp_visitor_id Duration 3 minutes Description Assigns a unique visitor identifier to measure usage, track article and page interactions, and compile readership analytics across repository content. Cookie original_referer Duration 2 minutes Description Stores the initial referring URL that brought visitors to the site, supporting attribution, analytics, campaign measurement, and redirect or navigation. Cookie YSC Duration session Description YSC cookie is set by Youtube and is used to track the views of embedded videos on Youtube pages. Cookie s_ips Duration session Description Adobe Analytics sets this cookie to store information required by the getPercentPageViewed plugin. Cookie s_tp Duration session Description Adobe Analytics sets this cookie to know how much of the page you viewed. Cookie s_ppv Duration session Description The cookie is used to determine the percentage of the page that has been displayed to the user. Cookie s_cc Duration session Description Adobe Analytics sets this cookie to determine whether or not cookies are enabled in the user's browser. Cookie s_ecid Duration 2 years Description Adobe installs this cookie to allow persistent ID tracking in the 1st party state and is used as a reference ID if the AMCV cookie has expired. Cookie ai_session Duration 1 hour Description This is a unique anonymous session identifier cookie set by Microsoft Application Insights software to gather statistical usage and telemetry data for apps built on the Azure cloud platform. Cookie _gat_gtag_UA_* Duration 1 minute Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to store a unique user ID. Cookie _gat_* Duration 1 minute Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to throttle the request rate. Cookie ___utmvc Duration Less than a minute Description The ___utmvc cookie is installed by Google Analytics to gather data on the user's site usage. This data is then used to compile reports and improve the site. Cookie _session_id Duration session Description _session_id cookie stores a unique identifier for a user's session, allowing servers to identify and track user activities within a website or application. Cookie amplitude_id_* Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Amplitude sets this cookie, which is used to uniquely identify the user's machine. Cookie amplitude_cookie_test Duration session Description Amplitude sets this cookie, which is used to uniquely identify the user's machine. Cookie __scuuid Duration 1 year Description Stores a unique visitor identifier for the SureCatch embed, enabling session continuity, lead capture analytics,